        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "84eed690-ab6a-5799-84b8-4a508c92de9f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Body of Proof season 2, Star Trek: Voyager\n- People: Christopher Murphey, Jeri Ryan, Jeri Lynn Zimmermann, Nicholas Bishop, John Carroll Lynch, Sonja Sohn, Geoffrey Arend, Windell Middlebrooks\n- Roles: Dr. Kate Murphy, Peter Dunlop, Bud Morris, Samantha Baker, Dr. Ethan Gross, Dr. Curtis Brumfield, Seven of Nine\n- Topics: television seasons, cast, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jeri Ryan was born as Jeri Lynn Zimmermann on February 22, 1968, and she is a German actress.\n- Jeri Ryan is best known for playing the Borg character Seven of Nine on Star Trek: Voyager.\n- Jeri Ryan was nominated four times for a Saturn Award for Star Trek: Voyager and won in 2001.\n- Christopher Murphey created the American television series Body of Proof.\n- The second season of Body of Proof aired in the United States from September 20, 2011, to April 10, 2012.\n- Body of Proof season 2 consisted of 20 episodes.\n- In Body of Proof season 2, Nicholas Bishop played Peter Dunlop, Jeri Ryan played Dr. Kate Murphy, John Carroll Lynch played Bud Morris, Sonja Sohn played Samantha Baker, Geoffrey Arend played Dr. Ethan Gross, and Windell Middlebrooks played Dr. Curtis Brumfield.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "f738f272-aa68-555b-8cd2-9e73a3a92b43",
        "text": "Page: Body of Proof (season 2). Sentence: The second season of \"Body of Proof\", an American television series created by Christopher Murphey, commenced airing in the United States on September 20, 2011, concluded April 10, 2012, and consisted of 20 episodes.\nPage: Body of Proof (season 2). Sentence: Along with Hunt solving homicide cases are her colleagues, Nicholas Bishop as Peter Dunlop, Jeri Ryan as Dr. Kate Murphy, John Carroll Lynch and Sonja Sohn as Detective's Bud Morris and Samantha Baker and fellow medical examiners, Geoffrey Arend as Dr. Ethan Gross and Windell Middlebrooks as Dr. Curtis Brumfield.\nPage: Jeri Ryan. Sentence: Jeri Lynn Ryan (born Jeri Lynn Zimmermann; February 22, 1968) is a German actress best known for her role as the Borg Seven of Nine on \"\", for which she was nominated four times for a Saturn Award and won in 2001.",
